  "Html": "<div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:10:09:12 Disqualification penalty is in addition to other sanctions or penalties.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:10:09:12\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:10:09:12 Disqualification penalty is in addition to other sanctions or penalties.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<title>CHAPTER 67:10:07</title>\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:10:09:12.&nbsp;&nbsp;Disqualification penalty is in addition to other\r\nsanctions or penalties.</b> If a disqualification penalty and other sanctions\r\nor penalties apply, the disqualification penalty must be adhered to and is in\r\naddition to any other sanction or penalty which may be imposed by law for the\r\nsame offense.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> 24 SDR\r\n24, effective August 31, 1997.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General Authority:</b>\r\nSDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-3\">28-7A-3(5).</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law Implemented:</b>\r\nSDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-3\">28-7A-3(5)</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-16\">28-7A-16.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div>",
